# Tests that fail on this mutant

## 1. f3_difference

A test that fails on this mutant: a differential run of invoicing.parse:split_fields, input line="a,", reference "['a,']", mutant raises IndexError. Re-run it with `spec-proof scan replay .spec-proof/scan/3f2a9c1/1`.

## 2. killed_by_test

A test that fails on this mutant: `tests/test_split.py::test_trailing_comma`, which fails 3/3. Run it with `sh killer-2.sh`.

## 3. witness_failure

A test that fails on this mutant: witness 9d1c0e77a4b2, in `witness/tests/test_promise_witness.py`. Run it with `sh killer-3.sh`.
